
; test-vault - a vault with an immediate clawback path and a delayed hot path
;
; The vault coin is spendable two ways:
;   clawback: the cold key signs, valid immediately, MODE = 1
;   hot spend: the hot key signs and the spending input must assert a
;     relative delay of at least DELAY blocks via its nSequence, MODE = 0
;
; The nSequence checks require the value to be below 2^16. BIP68 only
; reads the low 16 bits for the effective height delay, so any check
; that lets bits 16 to 31 float (disable bit 31, type bit 22, reserved
; bits) would let a value like 0x01000A pass a raw comparison against
; DELAY while carrying an effective delay of 10 blocks. Keeping the
; whole value under 2^16 makes the raw comparison equal the BIP68
; comparison. The transaction version must be at least 2 for BIP68 to
; apply. Note that the repl only evaluates the program against the
; provided transaction, it does not model BIP68 consensus enforcement,
; so the delay is only as real as the consensus rules that would
; surround a deployment.
;
; All hex constants below were produced by
;   python3 examples/gen-test-context.py vault
; The signatures commit to the transaction with SIGHASH_DEFAULT.
;
; Run with
;   echo "import examples/test-vault" | ./bllsh
; Piping the file itself into the repl re-runs each command at every
; blank line (cmd.Cmd repeats the last command on an empty input line),
; the import command skips blank lines.
;
; Expected results, in order: 1 (delay check alone), 1, 1, 1 and 1
; (the same spends through the compiled program), error (wrong key for
; the hot path), error (wrong key for the clawback), nil (delay check
; alone on the immature input), error (immature delay), 1, then the
; compiled program.

def COLDPK 0x79be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798
def HOTPK 0xc6047f9441ed7d6d3045406e95c07cd85c778e4b8cef3ca7abac09b95c709ee5
def DELAY 144

def (CHECKDELAY) (all (notall (< (tx 10) (DELAY))) (< (tx 10) 65536) (notall (< (tx 0) 2)))

def (CLAWBACK SIG) (bip340_verify (COLDPK) (bip342_txmsg) SIG)
def (HOTSPEND SIG) (all (CHECKDELAY) (bip340_verify (HOTPK) (bip342_txmsg) SIG))

def (VAULT MODE SIG) (if (if MODE (CLAWBACK SIG) (HOTSPEND SIG)) 1 (x "vault: spend not authorized"))

