; the same two spends through the compiled program instead of the
; symbll interpreter, the environment is the compiler's argument tree
; (MODE . SIG), expect 1 and 1
blleval @VAULT (0 . 0x47000aeb0132b9ae594ae887caea8f511ec6c40fe1ec6277f14793441fb94fa11349674decfc99c68b40d896b220282c4e8ebb7a1a12e74af1166369649c11b9)
